<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Food4You · Breathe Taste Innovate</title>
    <!-- ExcelJS: rellena la plantilla Excel (Pedido, Albarán y Factura) conservando su diseño -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/exceljs/4.4.0/exceljs.min.js"
            onerror="var s=document.createElement('script');s.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/exceljs@4.4.0/dist/exceljs.min.js';document.head.appendChild(s);"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;600&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary-blue: #093375;
            --primary-yellow: #fbbc05;
            --bg-color: #f4f7f9;
            --text-dark: #1a1a2e;
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            --glass-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(9, 51, 117, 0.08);
            --btn-bg: var(--primary-blue);
            --btn-text: #ffffff;
            --btn-hover: var(--primary-yellow);
            --btn-hover-text: #093375;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .ambient-bg {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            z-index: -1; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none;
        }
        .sphere {
            position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); opacity: 0.4;
            animation: float 20s infinite alternate cubic-bezier(0.45, 0.05, 0.55, 0.95);
        }
        .sphere-1 { width: 50vw; height: 50vw; background: var(--primary-blue); top: -10%; left: -10%; }
        .sphere-2 { width: 40vw; height: 40vw; background: var(--primary-yellow); bottom: -10%; right: -5%; animation-delay: -5s; }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
            100% { transform: translate(10%, 15%) scale(1.1); }
        }

        nav {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            z-index: 100; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }
        .nav-top {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 4%;
        }
        .logo-container { display: flex; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
        .logo-container img { height: 45px; }
        .cart-info {
            font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            border: 2px solid var(--primary-yellow); color: var(--primary-blue); transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cart-info:hover { background: var(--primary-yellow); }

        .nav-categories {
            display: flex; overflow-x: auto; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.8rem 4%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .cat-btn {
            background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue); color: var(--primary-blue);
            padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 30px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .cat-btn:hover, .cat-btn.active { background: var(--primary-blue); color: #fff; }

        .container { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 11rem 2rem 6rem; }
        .view-section { transition: opacity 0.5s ease; }
        .hidden-section { display: none !important; opacity: 0; }

        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2.5rem; }
        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease; box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
        }
        .glass-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); border-color: var(--primary-yellow); }
        .product-image-wrapper {
            width: 100%; height: 220px; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); display: flex; justify-content: center;
        }
        .product-image-wrapper img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
        .card-content h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .card-content p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #444; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .price { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .iva-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #777; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

        .card-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; }
        .btn {
            flex: 1; padding: 0.8rem; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--btn-bg); color: var(--btn-text); }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--btn-hover); color: var(--btn-hover-text); }
        .btn-secondary { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); border: 2px solid var(--primary-blue); color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--primary-blue); color: #fff; }

        /* Estilos del Ticket de Compra */
        .checkout-layout { display: flex; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .ticket-container {
            flex: 1; min-width: min(350px, 100%); background: #fff; border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-top: 8px solid var(--primary-blue);
        }
        .ticket-container h3 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--primary-blue); border-bottom: 2px dashed #ccc; padding-bottom: 1rem; }
        .ticket-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .ticket-table th, .ticket-table td { padding: 0.8rem 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; text-align: left; }
        .qty-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .qty-btn { background: #f0f0f0; border: none; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
        .qty-btn:hover { background: #ddd; }
        .delete-btn { color: red; background: none; border: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; }
        .ticket-totals { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: right; }
        .ticket-totals p { margin: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .ticket-totals h4 { margin: 1rem 0 0 0; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--primary-blue); }

        .form-container { flex: 1; min-width: min(350px, 100%); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 15px; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
        .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary-blue); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .form-control { width: 100%; padding: 0.9rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit; box-sizing: border-box; }

        /* Simulación de Correo Electrónico Modal */
        .email-modal-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px); z-index: 1000; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }
        .email-modal {
            background: #fff; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; max-width: 600px; width: 90%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); text-align: left;
        }
        .email-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .email-header p { margin: 0.3rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555; }
        .email-body { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .attachment-box {
            background: #f4f7f9; border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

    
        /* ---- País / UE ---- */
        .checkbox-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; padding: 0.9rem;
            border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff;
        }
        .checkbox-row input { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .checkbox-row label { display: inline; margin: 0; cursor: pointer; }
        .field-hint { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #777; margin-top: 0.4rem; }
        .iva-note { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--primary-blue); background: rgba(251,188,5,0.25); padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 6px; }
        .ticket-container { overflow-x: auto; }

        /* ---- Aviso tipo cookies ---- */
        .sim-banner {
            position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 1.2rem; transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: min(820px, calc(100% - 2rem)); z-index: 900;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-left: 6px solid var(--primary-yellow);
            border-radius: 16px; padding: 1rem 1.3rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(9,51,117,0.25);
            font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; box-sizing: border-box;
            animation: bannerUp 0.5s ease;
        }
        .sim-banner .btn { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem; }
        .sim-hide { display: none; }
        @keyframes bannerUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); } }
        @media (max-width: 600px) { .sim-banner { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; text-align: left; } }

        .sim-footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; padding: 0 1rem 7rem; }
    
        /* ---- Gracias por su compra ---- */
        .thanks-box { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .thanks-title { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem); color: var(--primary-blue); margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .thanks-box .attachment-box { text-align: left; }

        /* =================== LANDING: Breathe Taste Innovate =================== */
        nav.on-landing .nav-categories { display: none; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; }
        .nav-links a {
            cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--primary-blue);
            padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 20px; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { background: rgba(251,188,5,0.35); }
        @media (max-width: 700px) { .nav-links { display: none; } }

        #landing-view { padding: 0; }
        .landing { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary-blue);
            background: rgba(251,188,5,0.3); padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 30px;
        }
        .btn-lg { padding: 1.05rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem; flex: 0 0 auto; }

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; align-items: center;
            gap: 3rem; padding: 7.5rem 0 4rem; box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            margin: 1.6rem 0 1.4rem; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 9.5vw, 7.4rem); line-height: 0.94;
            font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: var(--primary-blue);
        }
        .hero h1 span { display: block; }
        .hero h1 .w2 { color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--primary-blue); }
        .hero h1 .w3 {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f5a800, var(--primary-yellow));
            -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
        }
        .hero-sub { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #3b4357; max-width: 36rem; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 2.2rem; }
        .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        .hero-visual { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 440px; }
        .logo-card {
            position: relative; z-index: 2; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 36px; padding: 2.4rem;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(9,51,117,0.18); width: min(360px, 80%); box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .logo-card img { width: 100%; display: block; }
        .ring { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px dashed rgba(9,51,117,0.22); animation: spin 40s linear infinite; }
        .ring.r1 { width: 460px; height: 460px; max-width: 100%; }
        .ring.r2 { width: 340px; height: 340px; border-color: rgba(251,188,5,0.55); animation-direction: reverse; animation-duration: 28s; }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .float-chip {
            position: absolute; z-index: 3; background: #fff; border-radius: 30px; padding: 0.65rem 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--primary-blue); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(9,51,117,0.16);
            border: 1px solid rgba(251,188,5,0.6); animation: bob 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .float-chip.fc1 { top: 8%; left: 2%; }
        .float-chip.fc2 { top: 46%; right: -2%; animation-delay: -2s; }
        .float-chip.fc3 { bottom: 6%; left: 8%; animation-delay: -4s; }
        @keyframes bob { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-12px); } }

        .section-head { text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0 2.5rem; }
        .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3rem); color: var(--primary-blue); margin: 1rem 0 0; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

        .pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; }
        .pillar { padding: 2.2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .pillar-num { font-size: 4.5rem; font-weight: 200; line-height: 1; color: rgba(9,51,117,0.12); }
        .pillar h3 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0.2rem 0 0.8rem; color: var(--primary-blue); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .pillar p { color: #3b4357; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; font-weight: 300; }
        .pillar ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1.8rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .pillar li {
            font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary-blue); background: rgba(251,188,5,0.28);
            padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 20px;
        }
        .pillar .btn { width: 100%; flex: none; }
        .pillar.p1 { border-top: 6px solid var(--primary-blue); }
        .pillar.p2 { border-top: 6px solid var(--primary-yellow); }
        .pillar.p3 { border-top: 6px solid #5b86c9; }

        .cta-band {
            margin: 6rem 0 2rem; text-align: center; color: #fff; border-radius: 32px; padding: 4rem 2rem;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(251,188,5,0.35), transparent 45%), linear-gradient(135deg, #093375, #0d4aa8);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(9,51,117,0.3);
        }
        .cta-band h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); margin: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .cta-band p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 auto 2rem; max-width: 34rem; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.92; }
        .btn-cta { background: var(--primary-yellow); color: var(--primary-blue); padding: 1.05rem 2.4rem; font-size: 1rem; flex: none; }
        .btn-cta:hover { background: #fff; }

        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease; }
        .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
            .sphere, .ring, .float-chip { animation: none; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 6.5rem; min-height: auto; }
            .hero-visual { min-height: 360px; order: -1; }
            .ring.r1 { width: 340px; height: 340px; } .ring.r2 { width: 250px; height: 250px; }
            .float-chip.fc2 { right: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="ambient-bg">
        <div class="sphere sphere-1"></div>
        <div class="sphere sphere-2"></div>
    </div>

    <nav id="navbar" class="on-landing">
        <div class="nav-top">
            <div class="logo-container" onclick="navigate('landing-view')">
                <img data-logo alt="Food4You">
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a onclick="navigate('landing-view')">Inicio</a>
                <a onclick="irATienda('All')">Tienda</a>
            </div>
            <div class="cart-info" onclick="navigate('checkout-view', null)">
                Cesta: <span id="cart-count">0</span> artículos
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-categories">
            <button class="cat-btn active" onclick="navigate('home-view', 'All', this)">Todos</button>
            <button class="cat-btn" onclick="navigate('home-view', 'Menús', this)">Menús</button>
            <button class="cat-btn" onclick="navigate('home-view', 'Electrodomésticos', this)">Electrodomésticos</button>
            <button class="cat-btn" onclick="navigate('home-view', 'Servicios', this)">Servicios</button>
            <button class="cat-btn" onclick="navigate('home-view', 'Accesorios', this)">Accesorios</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main id="landing-view" class="view-section">
        <div class="landing">

            <section class="hero">
                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Soluciones de cocina y alimentación para empresas</span>
                    <h1><span class="w1">Breathe</span><span class="w2">Taste</span><span class="w3">Innovate</span></h1>
                    <p class="hero-sub">Cocinas que respiran, sabores que enamoran y tecnología que trabaja por ti.
                        Food4You lleva a tu empresa menús, electrodomésticos inteligentes y servicios pensados para comer mejor con menos esfuerzo.</p>
                    <div class="hero-cta">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="irATienda('All')">Descubrir la tienda</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" onclick="irATienda('Menús')">Ver menús</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="ring r1"></div>
                    <div class="ring r2"></div>
                    <div class="logo-card"><img data-logo alt=""></div>
                    <span class="float-chip fc1">🌿 Sostenible</span>
                    <span class="float-chip fc2">🍽️ Sabor</span>
                    <span class="float-chip fc3">⚙️ Inteligente</span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">Nuestra filosofía</span>
                <h2>Tres ideas, una cocina mejor</h2>
            </div>
            <section class="pillars reveal">
                <article class="glass-card pillar p1">
                    <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
                    <h3>Breathe</h3>
                    <p>Cocinas que respiran. Cubertería sostenible, envases reutilizables con descuento por compras y salsas ZERO para comer mejor y generar menos residuos.</p>
                    <ul><li>Cubertería sostenible</li><li>Envases reutilizables</li><li>Salsas ZERO</li><li>Papelera inteligente</li></ul>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="irATienda('Accesorios')">Ver accesorios</button>
                </article>
                <article class="glass-card pillar p2">
                    <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
                    <h3>Taste</h3>
                    <p>Sabor sin renunciar a nada. Desayunos y almuerzos listos para tu equipo, también en versión sin gluten y sin lactosa.</p>
                    <ul><li>5 desayunos</li><li>5 almuerzos</li><li>Sin gluten y sin lactosa</li><li>Desde 4,50 €</li></ul>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="irATienda('Menús')">Ver menús</button>
                </article>
                <article class="glass-card pillar p3">
                    <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
                    <h3>Innovate</h3>
                    <p>Tecnología que trabaja por ti. Nevera inteligente con tablet, envío en dron, app móvil y electrodomésticos con inteligencia artificial.</p>
                    <ul><li>Nevera inteligente</li><li>Envío en dron</li><li>App del móvil</li><li>Air fryer con IA</li></ul>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="irATienda('Electrodomésticos')">Ver electrodomésticos</button>
                </article>
            </section>

            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">Productos destacados</span>
                <h2>Empieza por aquí</h2>
            </div>
            <section id="featured-grid" class="grid reveal"></section>

            <section class="cta-band reveal">
                <h2>Respira. Saborea. Innova.</h2>
                <p>Cada compra incluye su pedido, albarán y factura en Excel, listos para descargar.</p>
                <button class="btn btn-cta" onclick="irATienda('All')">Entrar a la tienda</button>
            </section>

        </div>
    </main>

    <main id="home-view" class="view-section hidden-section container">
        <section id="products-grid" class="grid"></section>
    </main>

    <main id="checkout-view" class="view-section hidden-section container">
        <div class="checkout-layout">
            
            <!-- Formulario de Datos -->
            <div class="form-container">
                <h2 style="color:var(--primary-blue); margin-top:0;">Datos de Facturación</h2>
                <form id="checkout-form" onsubmit="procesarPago(event)">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-name">Nombre de la Empresa o Cliente</label>
                        <input type="text" id="form-name" class="form-control" required placeholder="Ej. Ejemplo Cliente, S.L." autocomplete="organization">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-email">Correo Electrónico (E-mail)</label>
                        <input type="email" id="form-email" class="form-control" required placeholder="correo@empresa.com" autocomplete="email">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-nif">NIF / CIF / Identificación fiscal</label>
                        <input type="text" id="form-nif" class="form-control" required placeholder="Ej. B12345678">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-tel">Teléfono</label>
                        <input type="tel" id="form-tel" class="form-control" required placeholder="+34 600 000 000" autocomplete="tel">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="form-dir">Dirección Completa</label>
